.TH IPMITOOL.PY "1" "2026\-10\-10" "python\-ipmi" "python\-ipmi manual"
.SH NAME
ipmitool.py \- pure python IPMI tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ipmitool.py
[-h] [-V] [-v] [--log-level [<logger>=]<level>] [-J] [-I <interface>] [-o <options>] [-t <addr>] [-b <channel>] [-r <routing>] [-H <host>] [-p <port>] [-U <user>] [-P <password>] [-L <level>] <command> ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ipmitool.py
is the command line tool of the python\-ipmi library. It talks to IPMI
devices over the native RMCP and RMCP+ interfaces, the Linux IPMI and IPMB
drivers, an IPMB bus adapter or the
.BR ipmitool (1)
command as backend.
.PP
Despite its name it is not
.BR ipmitool (1)
and does not accept the same options and commands.

.SH
POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,raw\/\fR
Send a RAW IPMI request and print response
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,bmc\/\fR
Management Controller status and global enables
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,chassis\/\fR
Get the chassis status, control the power and set the chassis settings
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,fru\/\fR
Print and read built\-in FRU
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,lan\/\fR
Print and set the LAN configuration
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,sdr\/\fR
Print and manage the Sensor Data Repository (SDR) and the sensor readings
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,sel\/\fR
Print and manage the System Event Log (SEL)
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,sensor\/\fR
Sensor commands
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,hpm\/\fR
HPM.1 commands
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,picmg\/\fR
PICMG commands
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,dcmi\/\fR
Data Center Manageability Interface (DCMI) commands
.TP
\fBipmitool.py\fR \fI\,vita\/\fR
VITA 46.11 commands

